# tracertIP - local location hint table (template).
# token<TAB>IATA code of the metro<TAB>source. Every row is an inference: the
# judge only keeps it when physics allows it. Coordinates come from OurAirports
# through the IATA code. Copy to <bases dir>/geohints.tsv and fill it with the
# operator codes seen on your own paths. A token written as token.domain
# applies to that operator only (a code that means another city elsewhere).
exmpla	lax	Example: operator code for a Los Angeles site, from its public naming
exmplb.example.net	jfk	Example: code valid only under example.net, from its looking glass
